OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who relearned to walk eight
OL,4,Atimes defies odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has had to relearn how to
OL,7,Fwalk eight times is preparing to take
OL,8,Fon a charity trek despite living with a
OL,9,Fcondition that leaves her in constant
OL,10,Fpain.
OL,12,FEbony Clark, 24, from Hartcliffe,
OL,13,FBristol, has undergone multiple hip
OL,14,Foperations because of hypermobility, a
OL,15,Fcondition that causes her joints to
OL,16,Fdislocate easily and makes her bones
OL,17,Fextremely fragile.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34102
