OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1791008782
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWoman who relearned to walk eight
OL,4,Atimes defies odds
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe will attempt a fundraising walk for
OL,7,FThe Grand Appeal to support Bristol
OL,8,FRoyal Hospital for Children, where she
OL,9,Fspent much of her childhood as a
OL,10,Fpatient.
OL,12,FHer consultant, Dr James Barnes, said
OL,13,Fshe had "been through a lot" but had
OL,14,F"always remained positive", adding: "I
OL,15,Fwish Ebony the best of luck on her
OL,16,Fwalk."
